          "author": "London Rhymes",
          "description": "London Rhymes is a music charity for families with young children, producing original, catchy and eclectic tunes that are written with families around London. Smile! is our third Yoto Card from London Rhymes and is full of positive, upbeat and lively tunes. Great for singalongs, dance parties and for learning and memorising new words and patterns.\n\n1. Happy Happy Happy \n2. Zoom Zoom Zoom \n3. Let's Jam!\n4. We're All Amazing\n5. Let's Go Out\n6. Cheeky Monkey\n7. Let's Be Kind\n8. Octavia \n9. Baby Shark\n10. Biff the Balloon\n11. Rainbow\n12. I Got Feelings\n13. Yes I Can!",
